  "title": "Elon Musk's Midterm Spending and Political Alignment",
  "summary": "Elon Musk's record spending on US midterm elections, including a $366 million donation to right-wing campaigns, has been criticized by both his supporters and critics, as he aligns with Trump's political movement. His decision to distance himself from the 'Maga' movement has sparked debate.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Elon Musk's spending on the 2026 US midterm elections exceeds his 2024 contributions, targeting key midterms that will determine the US Senate.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Musk's $366 million donations to right-wing campaigns and political causes have been highlighted as a significant part of his spending, surpassing his prior contributions.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Musk's statement about being 'not Maga' and feeling 'pretty foolish' for his spending has been a point of discussion among his supporters and critics.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
